  "question": {
    "text": "The maximum vertical height to which a man can throw a ball is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>136</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. The maximum horizontal distance upto which he can throw the same ball is"
  },
  "options": [
